## Anti Pattern

**1. Manual Imports When Auto-Import Works**

Manually importing components/composables that Nuxt auto-imports. Adds unnecessary boilerplate. Reduces consistency.

**2. Blocking Async Data**

Not awaiting async data in setup. SSR hydration mismatches. Poor performance. Use proper data fetching composables.

**3. Mixing Client và Server State**

Not understanding where state lives. Hydration issues. Incorrect data on client. Use SSR-safe patterns.

**4. Ignoring SEO**

Not setting page metadata. Poor social sharing. Missing structured data. Use useSeoMeta and useHead.

**5. Heavy Client-Side Rendering**

Overusing client-only components. SEO impact. Performance degradation. Use SSR when possible.

